statue khelban gaul natas shaitan~
the statue of Khelban~
The statue of Khelban, the Lost Hero, stands here.
~
   Khelban, a lost but not forgotten friend of the entire land, will surely be
missed by mortals and imms alike.  He was always ready and willing to help
anybody on, or lead anybody on any run from ten minutes to two days in length.
This land lost a great asset in the fall of 2002 when justice took a blow and
Khelban was taken from us all.    
  The statue stands in a defiantly strong position, with a smile on his face and 
sweat on his brow.  His hand is extended towards you in friendship.
~
